# Per sub-feature w12.1 (release-pypi-trusted-publish), the release
# pipeline files require Chandler (release engineering owner) review
# before merge. This file plus the GitHub `release` environment's
# required_reviewers rule together enforce VAL-W12-003 (manual
# approval before publish): the environment gate runs at deploy time;
# CODEOWNERS gates the PR-time approval that lets the workflow file
# itself change.
#
# Format: https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-security/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners
#
# When sub-features w12.2..w12.6 land, they will add additional
# owners for their respective paths (TS release, SLSA workflow,
# in-toto layout, sidecar bundle, verify-install). Until then,
# Chandler is the sole owner of the release surface.

